 the European collaboration study on low-dose aspirin in polycythemia (ECLAP)</article-title><source>Pathol Biol (Paris)</source><year>2004</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>285</fpage><lpage>288</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15217715</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Landolfi</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Marchioli</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Kutti</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Gisslinger</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Tognoni</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Patrono</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Barbui</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><collab>European Collaboration on Low-Dose Aspirin in Polycythemia Vera Investigators</collab></person-group><article-title>Efficacy and safety of low-dose aspirin in polycythaemia vera</article-title><source>N Engl J Med</source><year>2004</year><volume>350</volume><fpage>114</fpage><lpage>124</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14711910</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1056/NEJMoa035572</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Gosk-Bierska</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Wysokinski</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Brown</surname><given-names>RD</given-names><suffix>Jr</suffix></name><name><surname>Karnicki</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Grill</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Wiste</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Wysokinska</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>McBane</surname><given-names>RD</given-names><suffix>2nd</suffix></name></person-group><article-title>Cerebral venous sinus thrombosis: Incidence of venous thrombosis recurrence and survival</article-title><source>Neurology</source><year>2006</year><volume>67</volume><fpage>814</fpage><lpage>819</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16966543</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1212/01.wnl.0000233887.17638.d0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Einhaupl</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Bousser</surname><given-names>MG</given-names></name><name><surname>de Bruijn</surname><given-names>SF</given-names></name><name><surname>Ferro</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Martinelli</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Masuhr</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Stam</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>EFNS guideline on the treatment of cerebral venous thrombosis and sinus thrombosis</article-title><source>Eur J Neurol</source><year>2006</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>553</fpage><lpage>559</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16796579</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1468-1331.2006.01398.x</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>